# Rewind Skin V3

Boutique luxury skincare studio in North York, Toronto. In-studio treatments and curated e-commerce retail on Shopify. No in-house product line.

Designer/Developer: George (Lifelike).

## Figma

- File key: `lwPjiKhA1GRP4OQxpttUxR`
- Frame naming: `[Seed] [BREAKPOINT] [Width Range] - Component/Page [State] [Theme]`
- Extraction happens in a separate workspace. This repo consumes the output.

## Design system

- `design-system/tokens.css` — CSS custom properties (canonical)
- `design-system/tokens.json` — structured for agent reasoning
- `design-system/extractions/` — raw extraction logs per component
- `docs/component-inventory.md` — tracks what's been identified and extracted

### Rules

- Never invent token values — flag missing tokens
- Never populate from brand guidelines — tokens come from V3 Figma designs
- George approves all token additions

## Build pipeline

- Tailwind v4 CLI: `src/v3.input.css` → `assets/v3.output.css`
- Capsize: `src/capsize-v3.js` → `assets/capsize-v3.css`
- Webpack: `src/global.js` → `assets/global.js` + `assets/global.css`
